Package: thorium-inbox
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Katus4 <62028361+Katus4@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: ca-certificates, libc6, libgcc-s1, libgssapi-krb5-2, libicu78 | libicu76 | libicu74 | libicu72 | libicu70, libssl3t64 | libssl3, libstdc++6, tzdata, zlib1g, libbrotli1, libfontconfig1, libx11-6, libice6, libsm6
Homepage: https://github.com/Katus4/thorium-inbox
Description: Inbox for Thorium Reader
 Watches a local folder and sends PDFs and EPUBs to Thorium Reader.
